---
code: lint-tool-failed-without-findings
when-fires: an external linter exited nonzero but produced nothing parseable. lint/source_external.rs. `{tool}` is the tool, `{rc}` its exit status.
why: 27R §8 delta-exit-trichotomy-sharpened - the adapter never interprets a foreign tool-rc beyond zero/nonzero (checkbashisms' additive 1|2|4 codes are the named trap), so an unexplained failure is reported as itself. World-as-payload: replay never runs a foreign tool.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc lint book.sh
warning[lint-tool-failed-without-findings]: `shellcheck` exited with status 2
without producing any findings Dorc could read, so its checks contributed
nothing here -- run it directly to see its own report.

$ dorc-loom --this vars
case: lint-tool-failed-without-findings
{{tool}} = "shellcheck"
{{rc}} = "2"
